        "TileImage": "$($repository 90505cde-9b68-488f-827b-ff81498264aa).Image",
        "Description": "Your target is Charles Blake III,  one of the candidates in the upcoming mayoral election. Our client&apos;s interests are... maligned with Blake&apos;s, so to speak. He is constantly surrounded by his campaign staff, so you&apos;ll have to rig this contract in your favor.\r\rYour second target is Sheriff Philip Housman, a man firmly in Blake&apos;s pocket. He is sure to connect the assassination of  Blake to our client, so he must be taken care of as well. \r\rBe careful to avoid collateral damage, 47.  Best of luck.",
